---
// Static file-tree container (stand-in for nextra's interactive <FileTree>).
---

<div
  class="my-6 inline-block min-w-[260px] border border-[var(--line)] px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[13px] leading-[1.9] text-[var(--text)] [&_li]:m-0 [&_li]:[list-style:none] [&_ul]:m-0 [&_ul]:[list-style:none] [&_ul]:pl-5"
>
  <ul class="!pl-0"><slot /></ul>
</div>
